  "description": "[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/ppt)\n\nD-1 until admission. Lee Dae-Pal, a freshman, heads to his apartment in Seoul with light steps, having finally achieved his dream of attending a university there. However, upon arriving at the villa with a fluttering heart, he encounters a pervert wearing no pants...! The chaotic cohabitation of Chun-Sik, the panty fashionista, and Dae-Pal, the five-star timid king, begins!",
